          "Once constructed in O(N) time, a Segment Tree supports both arbitrary interval queries and single-element updates in O(log N) worst-case time.",
          "Every range query over interval [ql, qr] classifies a node interval [l, r] into one of three deterministic cases: Complete Overlap, Disjoint, or Partial Overlap.",
