          "Now let us synthesize ALL FOUR probabilistic stream tools inside ONE cohesive telemetry engine: `StreamingTelemetrySketchEngine`.",
          "Imagine millions of API requests streaming past an edge proxy with strict fixed RAM budgets. As every event `(request_id, route_path)` enters the pipeline:",
          "(1) **Bloom Filter Deduplicator (`dedup`)** spots first-time vs replay `request_id` tokens with `0%` false negatives;",
          "(2) **Count-Min Sketch (`freq`)** increments route traffic counters in fixed `O(d * w)` space so downstream autoscalers surface true heavy hitters (`/checkout`, `/login`) cleanly without overflowing maps;",
          "(3) **HyperLogLog (`card`)** counts unique callers per minute across a tiny register array;",
          "(4) **Algorithm R Reservoir Sampler (`reservoir`)** captures an unbiased uniform audit slice of `K` raw records for offline forensic inspection! Execute this complete sub-linear pipeline deterministically below."
