          "Trace the core order-book lifecycle operations executed at matching speed: first, incoming limit quotes call `upsert(px_cents, shares)`, traversing top-down express lanes while capturing predecessor towers in `update[]`. If shares hit `0` (cancellation or full fill!), the entry unlinks across every tower tier cleanly and trims empty upper heights.",
